    => (empty)
?  => 20: [pon get transceiver vendor-name] [pon get transceiver part-number] [pon get transceiver temperature] [pon get transceiver voltage] [pon get transceiver bias-current] [pon get transceiver tx-power] [pon get transceiver rx-power] [pon get transceiver all] [pon get transceiver alarm-status] [gpon get onu-state] [gpon get alarm-status] [gpon get flows] [mib dump counter port <ports>] [l2-table get all] [l2-table get entry address valid] [l2-table get index <index>] [register get <address> <words>] [register set <address> <value>] [help] [exit]
? pon => 9: [pon get transceiver vendor-name] [pon get transceiver part-number] [pon get transceiver temperature] [pon get transceiver voltage] [pon get transceiver bias-current] [pon get transceiver tx-power] [pon get transceiver rx-power] [pon get transceiver all] [pon get transceiver alarm-status]
